[{"client_msg_id":"4c388a9e-b9dc-4261-b462-d1ab922a3b23","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"ですねー","ts":"1617179016.029000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rj8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1d6a1f74-cd55-4412-830b-a3a1e2c81318","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"あー、そのパッチが入ってるのであればバグですね。","ts":"1617176633.028400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"verified","count":1,"users":["U01H161HVPS"]},{"name":"mattn_yoshi","count":2,"users":["U01H161HVPS","U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3is"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bb2b8a8a-1eb6-44cf-b56a-450d18d741ef","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"なるほど!","ts":"1617176366.028100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZH4Lb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"528b4041-576b-4846-b2d8-34342f47a268","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"↑ のパッチで Vim9 でも（関数に？）ローカルな変数以外は `:lockvar`, `:unlockvar` が使えるようになったはずなのに、なんかいろいろおかしいのでは、という issue みたいですね","ts":"1617176294.027900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j2Hn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8559ed30-0e0d-4d8a-b710-914a34bd7e48","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"ついこの前これがはいりました","ts":"1617175959.025700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ur0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"49376854-12de-459e-b010-7f5b01b43e4b","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"コンパイルされるかどうか、というラインなのか","ts":"1617175958.025600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HrlGq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a9181f8-8ec4-44f4-85b8-dd63262104a2","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim/vim/commit/b2cb6c8bbd215177ed05c1d952e7ef2ad8f7ef4b\u003e","ts":"1617175937.024700","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: patch 8.2.2672: Vim9: cannot use :lockvar and :unlockvar in compiled … · vim/vim@b2cb6c8","id":1,"title":"patch 8.2.2672: Vim9: cannot use :lockvar and :unlockvar in compiled … · vim/vim@b2cb6c8","title_link":"https://github.com/vim/vim/commit/b2cb6c8bbd215177ed05c1d952e7ef2ad8f7ef4b","text":"…script Problem: Vim9: cannot use :lockvar and :unlockvar in compiled script. Solution: Implement locking support.","thumb_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11618545?s=400\u0026v=4","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","thumb_width":48,"thumb_height":48,"from_url":"https://github.com/vim/vim/commit/b2cb6c8bbd215177ed05c1d952e7ef2ad8f7ef4b","original_url":"https://github.com/vim/vim/commit/b2cb6c8bbd215177ed05c1d952e7ef2ad8f7ef4b"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EfZiG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ed4c3d38-d51e-4ae5-8041-b18c6fc98c6a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"でもスクリプトトップだと動いちゃってるのも片手落ちだなw","ts":"1617175936.024600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AT4G7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ab4bafc9-7a07-4648-8179-023f203454e8","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あー、たしかにそうですね、Vim9で明示してlockvarを弾いてないだけで、「VIm9で使えなくなってるよリスト」の1つなのかもしれませんね","ts":"1617175912.024200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bDV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aa9ac18c-eb81-4297-9a30-21527e2df4d0","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ドキュメントに instead と書いてあるので書いた時点で Bram は気付いてるし、バグというよりも lockvar は vim8 の為の物だと言ってる気がする。","ts":"1617175851.023400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xROyD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"af9fc3ce-ce43-4b8f-b6f9-48f50159c547","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"localな値をlockした時、def内ではlockが効かない(=チェックが走らない)みたいですね","ts":"1617175288.022400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P9R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a059493e-61ff-40c7-8c21-a8e7d214d0b5","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"Vim9でちゃんとロックできてない、ってことなのか?","ts":"1617174647.020300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nlvU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"468fbc90-6926-4e26-b6fd-47377a509191","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim/vim/issues/8031\u003e\nこれを見てたのですが,`:lockvar`はvim9.txtで\n\u0026gt; `:lockvar` does not work on local variables.  Use `:const` and `:final`\n\u0026gt; instead.\nと明記されているようですね.これはこの仕様自体に一貫性がないという意味のissueですか?","ts":"1617174341.019800","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: Vim9: no error for changing script-local variable in :def function when locked at script level · Issue #8031 · vim/vim","id":1,"title":"Vim9: no error for changing script-local variable in :def function when locked at script level · Issue #8031 · vim/vim","title_link":"https://github.com/vim/vim/issues/8031","text":"Describe the bug In Vim9 script, no error is raised when we change a script-local variable in a :def function, even though it was locked earlier at the script level. To Reproduce Run this shell com...","thumb_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11618545?s=400\u0026v=4","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","thumb_width":48,"thumb_height":48,"from_url":"https://github.com/vim/vim/issues/8031","original_url":"https://github.com/vim/vim/issues/8031"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g9w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b924ffa3-7f32-443b-aeb8-6ba0a342a653","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"実装が簡単だったので stdout に出力するようにしてみたが、ちゃんとログファイルを指定するようにした方がいいだろうか？","ts":"1617172447.017800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZQeJ/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"776b4a45-e5fa-4c62-9ca3-c82b7a901808","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"`gvim --help --testing` というようにオプションの順番を変えてしまうと、今まで通りメッセージボックスにヘルプが表示されてしまう。","ts":"1617172336.016700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IebM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d859fbe5-8ae1-4e66-b2f6-060e8aa71bda","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"`--testing` が指定されると、メッセージを stdout に出力するパッチ。\n\u003chttps://osdn.net/users/k_takata/pf/vim-ktakata-mq/scm/blobs/7ec4848be7c16bb7352a42f709556f8477a8be52/add-testing-option.patch\u003e\nコマンドラインから `gvim --testing ---help` とすると何も表示されないが、\n`gvim --testing ---help \u0026gt; help.log` とリダイレクトすればメッセージが取得できる。","ts":"1617172311.016300","attachments":[{"fallback":"File Details: /add-testing-option.patch (7ec4848be7c16bb7352a42f709556f8477a8be52) - vim-ktaka...","id":1,"title":"File Details: /add-testing-option.patch (7ec4848be7c16bb7352a42f709556f8477a8be52) - vim-ktaka...","title_link":"https://osdn.net/users/k_takata/pf/vim-ktakata-mq/scm/blobs/7ec4848be7c16bb7352a42f709556f8477a8be52/add-testing-option.patch","text":"File Details: /add-testing-option.patch (7ec4848be7c16bb7352a42f709556f8477a8be52) - vim-ktakata-mq (hg) #osdn","thumb_url":"https://static.osdn.net/OSDN_icon_125x125.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"osdn.net","service_icon":"https://osdn.net/favicon.ico","thumb_width":125,"thumb_height":125,"from_url":"https://osdn.net/users/k_takata/pf/vim-ktakata-mq/scm/blobs/7ec4848be7c16bb7352a42f709556f8477a8be52/add-testing-option.patch","original_url":"https://osdn.net/users/k_takata/pf/vim-ktakata-mq/scm/blobs/7ec4848be7c16bb7352a42f709556f8477a8be52/add-testing-option.patch"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gnC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"396b7da8-f021-4b2c-a562-823e62b2a140","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"この前のBramからの宿題、どうするかなと考えていた。\n\u003chttps://github.com/vim/vim/pull/7970#issuecomment-800221829\u003e","ts":"1617172243.015600","edited":{"user":"U6XP9LZ6V","ts":"1617172251.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U/hAE"}]}]
